# A centred input forms two images at 3 L_pi / 8, with L_pi = 42.56 um from the two lowest modes of the body.
# Reference: equal outputs by symmetry; near the imaging length each carries almost half.
title 1x2 multimode interferometer 4 um wide at 1 of the imaging length
reference 2.8
grid dx=0.02 dz=0.25
window width=14 length=41
guide straight x=0 width=1.2 from=0 to=10
guide straight x=0 width=4 from=10 to=26
guide straight x=1 width=1.2 from=26 to=41
guide straight x=-1 width=1.2 from=26 to=41
launch mode x=0 width=1.2
monitor upper z=41 x=1 width=1.2
monitor lower z=41 x=-1 width=1.2
plane end z=41
expect power upper 0.493043513 2e-7
expect power lower 0.493043513 2e-7
expect total end 0.999694486 2e-7
expect centroid end 0.0000000 2e-6
expect radius end 2.0186846 2e-6
expect neff 2.812129982 2e-8
expect ratio upper lower 1.0 1e-4
expect power_above upper 0.46
